{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">強颱風沙德爾吹襲日本沖繩及鹿兒島縣奄美地區，最少5人受傷，近4萬戶停電。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">周三沖繩與奄美風勢仍然強勁。日本氣象廳提醒相關地區可能出現猛烈強風，吹倒電線桿或建築物。鹿兒島縣及沖繩縣有多宗房屋受損報告，奄美有三萬多戶停電，沖繩也有二千多戶。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026gbJaCxYLBC1787724640.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">往返沖繩、鹿兒島等地的多個航班被取消，全日空周三有100個航班被取消，包括所有往返沖繩那霸機場航班。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026uMnOkNKzqL1787724628.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">氣象廳指，沙德爾周三中午在沖繩以北向西北方向移動，預計惡劣天氣還會持續，呼籲民眾防範強風巨浪，並警惕暴雨引發的山泥傾瀉等災害。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T06:19:55.018461+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}